        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Replacement of spare parts, assembly of semifinished components.\n\n# Included processes\nIncludes the initial OEM cartridge, the transports to the customer, the remanufacturing and disposal of spare parts and spare toner and the final disposal of the cartridge. No emissions due to printing contained.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
